 least $250 billion'): 1, ('Below 3.5%', '3.5% to below 3.9%', 'Near the July 2026 reading', '4.3% to below 4.7%', '4.7% or higher'): 1, ('Below 1.5 GW', '1.5 to below 1.9 GW', 'Near the stated expectation', '2.1 to below 2.5 GW', 'At least 2.5 GW'): 1, ('Lowest range', 'Lower range', 'Near forecast', 'Higher range', 'Highest range'): 1, ('Below $100 billion', '$100 billion to below $300 billion', '$300 billion to below $500 billion', '$500 billion to below $700 billion', '$700 billion or more'): 1, ('Below $650 billion', '$650 billion to below $700 billion', '$700 billion to below $790 billion', '$790 billion to below $850 billion', '$850 billion or more'): 1, ('Below $400 billion', '$400 billion to below $500 billion', '$500 billion to below $700 billion', '$700 billion to below $800 billion', '$800 billion or more'): 1, ('Below $450 billion', '$450 billion to below $550 billion', '$550 billion to below $650 billion', '$650 billion to below $750 billion', '$750 billion or more'): 1, ('Below $800 billion', '$800 billion to below $900 billion', '$900 billion to below $1 trillion', '$1 trillion to below $1.1 trillion', '$1.1 trillion or more'): 1, ('Below 4 GW', '4 GW to below 5 GW', '5 GW to below 10 GW', '10 GW to below 12 GW', '12 GW or more'): 1})\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
