ance.yahoo.com; original source Nokia ; from gnews:3c52e58b83c308775f689177 2026-09-16] Nokia said its AI-RAN platform had advanced from evaluation to live field trials with eight global operators.\\\\n    Quote: Nokia ( NYSE:NOK ) stock is rising in early Wednesday trading, up 6% to $10.39 after the company said its artificial intelligence-powered radio access network (AI-RAN) platform is moving from evaluation to live field trials at eight global operators.\\\\n- e5115 [third_party_view; John Bromels; original source John Bromels 2026-09-16; from gnews:ea516c504dd7e1c928df6d60 2026-09-16] The author calculates that NVIDIA revenue grew 1,150% over the five years before publication.\\\\n    Quote: Over the last five years, Nvidia's revenue has grown 1,150%\\\\n- e5118 [fact; gurufocus.com; original source CoreWeave ; from gnews:7518d37391aa449621d707a1 2026-09-16] CoreWeave brought NVIDIA\\\\u2019s multi-rack Vera Rubin NVL72 platform online, connecting hundreds of Rubin GPUs; the deployment follows its June launch of a single rack.\\\\n    Quote: CoreWeave ( CRWV ) shares climbed about 3% on Wednesday trading after the AI cloud company said it had brought Nvidia's ( NVDA ) multi-rack Vera Rubin NVL72 platform online. The new deployment connects hundreds of Rubin GPUs into a unified computing cluster designed to support large-scale artificial intelligence workloads. The rollout builds on CoreWeave's June launch of a single Vera Rubin NVL72 \\\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e5140; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\\\n- e5119 [third_party_view; Zacks; original source WSTS ; from gnews:fc6c2e31b8c175953657a182 2026-09-16] WSTS forecast global semiconductor sales of $1.51 trillion in calendar 2026, up 89.9%.\\\\n    Quote: WSTS expects global semiconductor sales to grow 89.9% in 2026 to $1.51 trillion, highlighting the extraordinary strength of the current cycle.\\\\n- e5120 [third_party_view; Zacks; original source IDC ; from gnews:fc6c2e31b8c175953657a182 2026-09-16] IDC forecast semiconductor revenue growth of 52.8% in calendar 2026, driven primarily by AI infrastructure investment.\\\\n    Quote: IDC also expects exceptional growth in 2026, with semiconductor revenue rising 52.8%, driven overwhelmingly by AI infrastructure investment.\\\\n- e5121 [third_party_view; Zacks; original source Gartner ; from gnews:fc6c2e31b8c175953657a182 2026-09-16] Gartner forecast global semiconductor revenue of $1.56 trillion in calendar 2026, up 92%.\\\\n    Quote: Gartner expects semiconductor revenue to grow 92% in 2026 to $1.56 trillion.\\\\n- e5123 [third_party_view; Zacks; original source Technavio ; from gnews:fc6c2e31b8c175953657a182 2026-09-16] Technavio estimates military and aerospace semiconductor-market growth at a 6% CAGR through 2029.\\\\n    Quote: Tachnavio estimates that semiconductors used in the military and aerospace market will grow at a 6% CAGR through 2029.\\\\n- e5124 [fact; Zacks; original source NVIDIA ; from gnews:fc6c2e31b8c175953657a182 2026-09-16] NVIDIA reported FY2027 second-quarter revenue growth of 106% year over year and 18% sequentially; Data Center revenue was $89 billion, up 117% year over year and 18% sequentially.\\\\n    Quote: NVIDIA's second-quarter fiscal 2027 revenue surged 106% year over year and 18% sequentially, while Data Center revenue jumped 117% year over year and 18% sequentially to $89 billion.\\\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e4672, e5199; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\\\n- e5125 [party_statement; Zacks; original source NVIDIA management ; from gnews:fc6c2e31b8c175953657a182 2026-09-16] NVIDIA management said AI demand was accelerating and the infrastructure buildout was expanding across frontier AI labs, startups, open-model developers, enterprises, sovereign AI and physical AI.\\\\n    Quote: Management said AI demand is accelerating, with the buildout expanding beyond the major hyperscalers to multiple frontier AI labs, startups, the open-model ecosystem, enterprises, sovereign AI initiatives and physical AI.\\\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e3493; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\\\n- e5127 [party_statement; Zacks; original source NVIDIA management ; from gnews:fc6c2e31b8c175953657a182 2026-09-16] NVIDIA management said more than 350 factories across 30 countries were ramping the Vera Rubin platform.\\\\n    Quote: Management has said that more than 350 factories across 30 countries are ramping NVIDIA's Vera Rubin platform.\\\\n    Opinion, not verified: the matcher read this as the same claim as e938; the argument counts one claim, one more outlet.\\\\n- e5129 [third_party_view; Zacks; original source Analysts ; from gnews:fc6c2e31b8c175953657a182 2026-09-16] Analysts forecast NVIDIA revenue growth of 88% and earnings growth of 93.5% in FY2027, followed by revenue growth of 65.5% and earnings growth of 66% in FY2028.\\\\n    Quote: Analysts currently expect revenue and earnings to grow a respective 88% and 93.5% this year followed by a respective 65.5% and 66% in the next.\\\\n- e5134 [third_party_view; trefis.com; original source trefis.com 2026-09-16; from gnews:106a61a1ef10fb3ba6adb1cd 2026-09-16] Trefis calculates NVIDIA trailing-twelve-month revenue at $302.97 billion, up 83.4% year over year; the exact twelve-month period is not specified.\\\\n    Quote: Revenue over the trailing twelve months is $302.97 billion, up 83.4% from a year earlier.\\\\n- e5136 [party_statement; trefis.com; original source NVIDIA management ; from gnews:106a61a1ef10fb3ba6adb1cd 2026-09-16] Vera Rubin shipments started in August 2026, and NVIDIA management expects the platform to account for about 20% of Data Center revenue in fiscal Q3 2027.\\\\n    Quote: Vera Rubin shipments started in August 2026, and management expects that platform to be about 20% of data center revenue in fiscal Q3 2027.\